# Claude Code
# Per-user local overrides. Claude Code reads this alongside the shared
# .claude/settings.json and it takes precedence, so it's the escape hatch for
# machine-specific settings that must not become project policy. The shared
# .claude/settings.json is committed; this one never is.
.claude/settings.local.json
